-- src:TA1999-RG5-S114-2001:1818 | Info-communications Development
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S114-2001:1819 | Authority of Singapore.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S114-2001:1821 | [AG/LEG/SL/323/2000/1 Vol. 2]
@ref Rg 5 as made, S 114/2001 (src:TA1999-RG5-S114-2001:3-1821)
GIVEN regulation IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` MEANS
    BRANCH IF regulation EQUALS "2" OR regulation EQUALS "3" OR regulation EQUALS "4" OR regulation EQUALS "5" OR regulation EQUALS "6" OR regulation EQUALS "7" OR regulation EQUALS "8" OR regulation EQUALS "10" OR regulation EQUALS "11" OR regulation EQUALS "12" OR regulation EQUALS "13" OR regulation EQUALS "14" OR regulation EQUALS "15" OR regulation EQUALS "16" OR regulation EQUALS "17" OR regulation EQUALS "18" OR regulation EQUALS "19" OR regulation EQUALS "21" OR regulation EQUALS "22" OR regulation EQUALS "23" OR regulation EQUALS "24" OR regulation EQUALS "25" OR regulation EQUALS "27" OR regulation EQUALS "30" OR regulation EQUALS "31" OR regulation EQUALS "32" OR regulation EQUALS "33" OR regulation EQUALS "34" OR regulation EQUALS "35" OR regulation EQUALS "37" OR regulation EQUALS "39" OR regulation EQUALS "41" OR regulation EQUALS "42" OR regulation EQUALS "43" OR regulation EQUALS "44" OR regulation EQUALS "45" OR regulation EQUALS "46" OR regulation EQUALS "47" OR regulation EQUALS "48" OR regulation EQUALS "49" OR regulation EQUALS "50" OR regulation EQUALS "51" OR regulation EQUALS "52" OR regulation EQUALS "55" OR regulation EQUALS "56" OR regulation EQUALS "57" OR regulation EQUALS "58" OR regulation EQUALS "59" OR regulation EQUALS "62" OR regulation EQUALS "63" OR regulation EQUALS "64" OR regulation EQUALS "65" OR regulation EQUALS "68" OR regulation EQUALS "69" OR regulation EQUALS "71" OR regulation EQUALS "73" OR regulation EQUALS "75" OR regulation EQUALS "77" OR regulation EQUALS "78" THEN JUST TRUE
           IF regulation EQUALS "1" OR regulation EQUALS "9" OR regulation EQUALS "20" OR regulation EQUALS "26" OR regulation EQUALS "28" OR regulation EQUALS "29" OR regulation EQUALS "36" OR regulation EQUALS "38" OR regulation EQUALS "40" OR regulation EQUALS "53" OR regulation EQUALS "54" OR regulation EQUALS "60" OR regulation EQUALS "61" OR regulation EQUALS "66" OR regulation EQUALS "67" OR regulation EQUALS "70" OR regulation EQUALS "72" OR regulation EQUALS "74" OR regulation EQUALS "76" OR regulation EQUALS "79" OR regulation EQUALS "80" THEN JUST FALSE
           IF regulation EQUALS "Second Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Third Schedule" THEN JUST TRUE
           IF regulation EQUALS "First Schedule" THEN JUST FALSE
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN regulation IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): how the words of the regulation differ from the 2002 Revised Edition` MEANS
    BRANCH IF regulation EQUALS "2" OR regulation EQUALS "3" OR regulation EQUALS "4" OR regulation EQUALS "5" OR regulation EQUALS "6" OR regulation EQUALS "7" OR regulation EQUALS "8" OR regulation EQUALS "10" OR regulation EQUALS "11" OR regulation EQUALS "12" OR regulation EQUALS "13" OR regulation EQUALS "14" OR regulation EQUALS "15" OR regulation EQUALS "16" OR regulation EQUALS "17" OR regulation EQUALS "18" OR regulation EQUALS "19" OR regulation EQUALS "21" OR regulation EQUALS "22" OR regulation EQUALS "23" OR regulation EQUALS "24" OR regulation EQUALS "25" OR regulation EQUALS "27" OR regulation EQUALS "30" OR regulation EQUALS "31" OR regulation EQUALS "32" OR regulation EQUALS "33" OR regulation EQUALS "34" OR regulation EQUALS "35" OR regulation EQUALS "37" OR regulation EQUALS "39" OR regulation EQUALS "41" OR regulation EQUALS "42" OR regulation EQUALS "43" OR regulation EQUALS "44" OR regulation EQUALS "45" OR regulation EQUALS "46" OR regulation EQUALS "47" OR regulation EQUALS "48" OR regulation EQUALS "49" OR regulation EQUALS "50" OR regulation EQUALS "51" OR regulation EQUALS "52" OR regulation EQUALS "55" OR regulation EQUALS "56" OR regulation EQUALS "57" OR regulation EQUALS "58" OR regulation EQUALS "59" OR regulation EQUALS "62" OR regulation EQUALS "63" OR regulation EQUALS "64" OR regulation EQUALS "65" OR regulation EQUALS "68" OR regulation EQUALS "69" OR regulation EQUALS "71" OR regulation EQUALS "73" OR regulation EQUALS "75" OR regulation EQUALS "77" OR regulation EQUALS "78" OR regulation EQUALS "Second Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Third Schedule" THEN JUST "no difference in the words"
           IF regulation EQUALS "1" THEN JUST "the as-made citation reads '... Regulations 2001 and shall come into operation on 2nd March 2001'; the Revised Edition reads '... Regulations'"
           IF regulation EQUALS "9" THEN JUST "paragraph (1) is one sentence as made and is divided into (a) and (b) in the Revised Edition, which also reads 'person engages' for 'persons engaged'"
           IF regulation EQUALS "20" THEN JUST "the paragraphs are in a different order: as made (b) is a company incorporated under the Companies Act and (c) a registered business; the Revised Edition has them the other way round"
           IF regulation EQUALS "26" THEN JUST "S 450/2001 clause 2 substitutes paragraph (4); the Revised Edition prints the substituted paragraph"
           IF regulation EQUALS "28" THEN JUST "S 450/2001 clause 3 adds paragraph (1)(d), the Fixed Wireless Network Licence; the Revised Edition prints it"
           IF regulation EQUALS "29" THEN JUST "as made it cites the Radiocommunication (Certificates of Competency for Ship Station Operators) Regulations (Rg 2); the Revised Edition cites the Telecommunications (Certificates of Competency for Ship Station Operators) Regulations (Rg 1)"
           IF regulation EQUALS "36" THEN JUST "the Revised Edition's paragraph (b) adds the words 'in exceptional circumstances', which neither S 374/2001 nor S 450/2001 inserts"
           IF regulation EQUALS "38" THEN JUST "the Revised Edition omits 'and' after 'approved by the Authority' and 'in' before 'these regulations'"
           IF regulation EQUALS "40" THEN JUST "'one year' as made, '12 months' in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "53" THEN JUST "'for his or its use' as made, 'for his use' in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "54" THEN JUST "the Revised Edition omits the word 'station' after 'the International Telecommunication Convention'"
           IF regulation EQUALS "60" THEN JUST "the Revised Edition labels the two limbs of the prohibition (a) and (b)"
           IF regulation EQUALS "61" THEN JUST "'or its' is omitted in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "66" THEN JUST "the Revised Edition omits the words 'comprised therein is'"
           IF regulation EQUALS "67" THEN JUST "'or its' is omitted in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "70" THEN JUST "'or its' is omitted three times in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "72" THEN JUST "'or its' is omitted in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "74" THEN JUST "'or its' is omitted, and the words 'electrical, electronic or radio-communication' are placed differently in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "76" THEN JUST "the Revised Edition adds '2000 (G.N. No. S 412/2000)' after the Code of Practice's name"
           IF regulation EQUALS "79" THEN JUST "the heading reads 'Revocation, savings and transitional provisions' as made and 'Savings and transitional provisions' in the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "80" THEN JUST "paragraph (1), which revokes the Radiocommunication Regulations (Cap. 323, Rg 3), is omitted in the Revised Edition, which begins 'Notwithstanding the revocation of'"
           IF regulation EQUALS "First Schedule" THEN JUST "layout, and the 2001 amendments: Part I item 4 and Part II item 11 name a Fixed Wireless Broadband Network, Part II item 7(c) a Ground Earth Station, and Part II has no item 12 as made"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `S 339/2001: Part II item 11 inserted by the Minister, published in error (in operation 9 July 2001)`

-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:15 | In exercise of the powers conferred by section 74 of the
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:16 | Telecommunications Act, the Minister for Communications and
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:17 | Information Technology hereby makes the following Regulations:
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:19 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:20 | 1. These Regulations may be cited as the Telecommunications
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:21 | (Radio-communication) (Amendment) Regulations 2001 and shall
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:22 | come into operation on 9th July 2001.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:24 | Amendment of First Schedule
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:25 | 2. Part II of the First Schedule to the Telecommunications (Radio-
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:26 | communication) Regulations 2001 (G.N. No. S 114/2001) is amended
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:27 | by inserting, immediately after item 10, the following item:
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:29 | 11. Fixed Wireless Broadband Network $500 per group
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:30 | of 50 stations or
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:31 | part thereof. ’’.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:34 | Made this 22nd day of June 2001.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:37 | CHAN HENG LOON ALAN
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:38 | Permanent Secretary,
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:39 | Ministry of Communications and
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:40 | Information Technology,
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:41 | Singapore.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:43 | [AG/LEG/SL/323/2000/1 Vol. 3]
@ref Rg 5 as amended, S 339 2001 (src:TA1999-RG5-S339-2001:15-43)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 5 S 339/2001 is read as in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
        (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001))
    AND (`reading day` LESS THAN (Date 1 8 2001))  -- from 1 Aug 2001 it is "to be treated as cancelled" (S 373/2001), and S 374/2001 gives the same insertion

§ `S 373/2001: the Corrigendum cancelling S 339/2001 (first published 1 August 2001)`

-- src:TA1999-RG5-S373-2001:17 | It is hereby notified for general information that the
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S373-2001:18 | Telecommunications (Radio-communication) (Amendment)
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S373-2001:19 | Regulations 2001 (G.N. No. S 339/2001) which have been
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S373-2001:20 | published in error are to be treated as cancelled.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S373-2001:23 | [AG/LEG/SL/323/2001/1 Vol. 3]
@ref Rg 5 as amended, S 373 2001 (src:TA1999-RG5-S373-2001:17-23)
GIVEN `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 5 S 339/2001 is treated as cancelled for a reader on the reading day` MEANS `reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 8 2001)

