-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:17 | Authority of Singapore, with the approval of the Minister for
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:18 | Communications and Information Technology, hereby makes the
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:19 | following Regulations:
