-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:26 | Amendment of regulation 26
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:27 | 2. Regulation 26 of the Telecommunications (Radio-
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:28 | communication) Regulations 2001 (G.N. No. S 114/2001) (referred to
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:29 | in these Regulations as the principal Regulations) is amended by
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:30 | deleting paragraph (4) and substituting the following paragraph:
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:31 | ‘‘(4) The Authority may, in the interest of spectrum economy
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:32 | and after considering the re-usability of a radio frequency, the
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:33 | area of coverage involved and the period of use of an assigned
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:34 | radio frequency, reduce all or any of the following:
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:35 | (a) licence fees payable under paragraph (1);
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:36 | (b) application and processing fees payable under
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:37 | paragraph (2); or
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:38 | (c) annual fees payable under paragraph (3).’’.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:40 | Amendment of regulation 28
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:41 | 3. Regulation 28 (1) of the principal Regulations is amended —
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:42 | (a) by deleting the word ‘‘and’’ at the end of paragraph (b); and
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:45 | (b) by deleting the full-stop at the end of paragraph (c) and
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:46 | substituting the word ‘‘; and’’, and by inserting immediately
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:47 | thereafter the following paragraph:
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:48 | ‘‘(d) Fixed Wireless Network Licence.’’.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:50 | Amendment of First Schedule
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:51 | 4. The First Schedule to the principal Regulations is amended —
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:52 | (a) by deleting the word ‘‘Broadband’’ in item 4 of Part I;
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:53 | (b) by deleting the word ‘‘Ground’’ in item 7 (c) of Part II;
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:54 | (c) by deleting the word ‘‘Broadband’’ in item 11 of Part II; and
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:55 | (d) by inserting, immediately after item 11 of Part II, the
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:56 | following item:
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:57 | ‘‘ 12. Special Purpose Station $50.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:60 | [G.N. No. S 374/2001]
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:63 | Made this 18th day of September 2001.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:66 | LAM CHUAN LEONG
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:67 | Chairman,
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:68 | Info-communications Development
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:69 | Authority of Singapore.
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:71 | [AG/LEG/SL/323/2001/1 Vol. 3]
@ref Rg 5 as amended, S 450 2001 (src:TA1999-RG5-S450-2001:15-71)
-- The categories the First Schedule names at the entries the 2001 amendments touch, version by version.  An entry that does not exist yet answers "no such entry".
-- As made: Part I item 4 "Fixed Wireless Broadband Network" ($500 per group of 50 stations or part thereof), Part II item 7(c) "Ground Earth Station" ($100), Part II items 1 to 10 only.
-- S 339/2001 and S 374/2001: Part II item 11 "Fixed Wireless Broadband Network" ($500 per group of 50 stations or part thereof).
-- S 450/2001: "Broadband" deleted in Part I item 4 and Part II item 11, "Ground" deleted in Part II item 7(c), Part II item 12 "Special Purpose Station" ($50) inserted.
GIVEN entry IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 5 First Schedule as made: the category named at the entry` MEANS
    BRANCH IF entry EQUALS "Part I item 4" THEN JUST "Fixed Wireless Broadband Network"
           IF entry EQUALS "Part II item 7(c)" THEN JUST "Ground Earth Station"
           IF entry EQUALS "Part II item 11" OR entry EQUALS "Part II item 12" THEN JUST "no such entry"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN entry IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 5 First Schedule as amended by S 339/2001 or S 374/2001: the category named at the entry` MEANS
    BRANCH IF entry EQUALS "Part II item 11" THEN JUST "Fixed Wireless Broadband Network"
           OTHERWISE `Rg 5 First Schedule as made: the category named at the entry` entry

GIVEN entry IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 5 First Schedule as amended by S 450/2001: the category named at the entry` MEANS
    BRANCH IF entry EQUALS "Part I item 4" OR entry EQUALS "Part II item 11" THEN JUST "Fixed Wireless Network"
           IF entry EQUALS "Part II item 7(c)" THEN JUST "Earth Station"
           IF entry EQUALS "Part II item 12" THEN JUST "Special Purpose Station"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN entry IS A STRING
      `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 5 First Schedule: the category named at the entry, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) THEN `Rg 5 First Schedule as amended by S 450/2001: the category named at the entry` entry
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 1 8 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001)) THEN `Rg 5 First Schedule as amended by S 339/2001 or S 374/2001: the category named at the entry` entry
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 9 7 2001)) THEN `Rg 5 First Schedule as amended by S 339/2001 or S 374/2001: the category named at the entry` entry
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) THEN `Rg 5 First Schedule as made: the category named at the entry` entry
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- Regulation 26(4), the Authority's power to reduce fees.  As made it reaches the application and processing fees of paragraph (2) and the annual fees of paragraph (3) "or both"; S 450/2001
-- substitutes "all or any of" the licence fees of paragraph (1), the application and processing fees of paragraph (2) and the annual fees of paragraph (3).
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`Rg 5 reg 26(4): the fees the Authority may reduce, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) THEN JUST (LIST "licence fees payable under paragraph (1)", "application and processing fees payable under paragraph (2)", "annual fees payable under paragraph (3)")
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) THEN JUST (LIST "application and processing fees payable under paragraph (2)", "annual fees payable under paragraph (3)")
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- Regulation 28(1), the classes of network licence the Authority may grant.
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`Rg 5 reg 28(1): the classes of network licence the Authority may grant, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 18 9 2001)) THEN JUST (LIST "Localised Private Network Licence", "Wide-area Private Network Licence", "Public Mobile Network Licence", "Fixed Wireless Network Licence")
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) THEN JUST (LIST "Localised Private Network Licence", "Wide-area Private Network Licence", "Public Mobile Network Licence")
           OTHERWISE NOTHING
